  "difficulty": 4,
  "marks": 1,
  "estimatedSeconds": 90,
  "stem": "$f(x) = x^{3} + ax + b$. The expression $x - 1$ is a factor of $f(x)$, and the remainder when $f(x)$ is divided by $x + 1$ is $4$. What is the value of $b$?",
  "options": [
